cff-version: 1.2.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.19744706"
title: "FLIM Playground: A FLIM-focused framework for multimodal single-cell imaging"
abstract: >-
  An interactive framework for extracting and analyzing single-cell measurements,
  centered on fluorescence lifetime imaging microscopy (FLIM), with quantitative
  phase imaging (QPI) support and interactive analysis of user-supplied tabular
  datasets. The framework is designed to expand to additional imaging modalities.
